  "summary_en": "Commission report under Article 12(5) of the Energy Efficiency Directive assessing first-period reporting data on EU data centre energy and water efficiency (PUE 1.36, WUE 0.58, ERF about 1.8%, REF 0.86). It outlines simplified reporting, a common EU rating scheme, planned minimum performance standards, and no separate net-zero regulation.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "770 data centres reported (~36% of estimated total); 70.1% of data deemed reliable",
   "EU average PUE 1.36, WUE 0.58, REF 0.86; only ~1.8% of waste heat reused",
   "Simplify reporting scheme, drop data traffic indicators, add nuclear energy consumption",
   "Rating scheme adopted via Delegated Regulation (EU) 2026/7000",
   "Call for evidence and consultation on minimum performance standards for PUE, WUE, REF; no specific net-zero regulation"
  ],
